y":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, February to March and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 34 of the 75 years since 1951 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids. In 2025 the middle ran 65% of normal for August to September and 159% for January to February. So far in 2026 the middle sat at 67% for March to April and 102% for June to July. Grid 21791 had its driest year in 1963 at 71% of normal.</p>"}
